<title>UK: BT boosts year pre-profits to 3.2 bln stg.</title>
<headline>BT boosts year pre-profits to 3.2 bln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		32.8		   vs 31.6</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 19.85		  vs 18.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     3.203 billion	vs 3.019 billion</p>
<p> Turnover		   14.935 billion     vs 14.446 billion</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 3.224 and 3.175 billion stg. Four quarter pre-tax profits came in at 695 million stg against 584 million last time.</p>
<p>Full company name - British Telelcommunications Plc.</p>
</text>
